<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-044" chapter-id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan" source-id="s-nanshi-044-zilong-nan-ws2027785">
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">娶尚書令<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p001:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">王儉</persName>女為妃。武帝以<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p001:m0013" ref="4tg_ud8_zdy">子隆</persName>能屬文，謂<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p001:m0020" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>曰：「我家東阿也。」</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p002:m0000" ref="4tg_ud8_zdy">子隆</persName>年二十一，而體過充壯，常使<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zilong-nan:p002:m0015" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_ABA">徐嗣伯</persName>合蘆茹丸以服自銷損，猶無益。</p>
</text>
